---
import Layout from '~/layouts/PageLayout.astro';

const metadata = {
  title: 'About LifeWebLab',
};
---

<Layout metadata={metadata}>
  <section class="px-6 sm:px-6 py-12 sm:py-16 lg:py-20 mx-auto max-w-4xl">
    <header class="mb-8 md:mb-12 text-center">
      <h1
        class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold leading-tighter tracking-tighter mb-4 font-heading dark:text-gray-200"
      >
        About LifeWebLab
      </h1>
      <p class="text-muted dark:text-slate-400 text-lg">
        Global Payment Solutions, Billing Systems Architecture, and Cross-Border Transaction Troubleshooting
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="mx-auto prose prose-lg dark:prose-invert max-w-none">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-8 mb-4">Our Mission</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-6">
        <strong>LifeWebLab</strong> (<a href="https://lifeweblab.com" class="text-primary hover:underline"
          >lifeweblab.com</a
        >) is an independent technical publication dedicated to demystifying global digital payments, electronic
        invoicing, and cross-border billing troubleshooting.
      </p>
      <p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-6">
        In an increasingly interconnected digital economy, payment failures directly impact revenue, business
        continuity, and customer trust. Rather than generic banking advice, our focus is on structured, actionable
        guides—dissecting gateway error codes, multi-currency settlement snags, card decline triggers, and invoice
        compliance workflows—to deliver practical, deterministic solutions for developers, freelancers, and global
        merchants.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4">What We Cover</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-3 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 mb-6">
        <li>
          <strong>Payment Gateway Troubleshooting:</strong> Actionable resolutions for cryptic error codes, webhook delivery
          failures, and dispute handling across Stripe, PayPal, Wise, and global processors.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Credit Card & Merchant Processing:</strong> Root causes of international payment declines, 3D Secure (3DS)
          authentication failures, address verification (AVS) mismatches, and fraud block bypasses.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Cross-Border Banking & Wire Transfers:</strong> Decoding SWIFT/BIC routes, SEPA processing timelines, intermediary
          bank fees, and currency conversion fee optimization.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Digital Invoicing & Tax Compliance:</strong> Best practices for automated billing, VAT/GST cross-border
          invoice requirements, W-8BEN compliance, and recurring subscription churn reduction.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Platform & SaaS Checkout Integrations:</strong> Troubleshooting checkout funnels, API rate limits, sandbox
          vs. production configuration errors, and localized payment method setups.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4">Editorial & Technical Standards</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-6">
        Every troubleshooting framework, API diagnostic step, and payment workflow published on LifeWebLab is grounded
        in official gateway documentation, real-world testing, and verified financial compliance standards. We
        prioritize clear step-by-step procedures to help international businesses and individual professionals quickly
        restore transaction flows and eliminate billing friction.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
